WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.159 --> 00:00:04.409
Without a family, man, alone in the world, trembles with the cold.

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:09.420
When the old one was awakened, the deep fog spread over the world, and

00:00:09.849 --> 00:00:15.689
from the fog came demons. A horde that swept through Boletaria and brought civilization to its knees.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:24.269
The old one is a bottomless pit of nothingness with an insatiable appetite for souls, but it cannot collect souls itself.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:28.080
Imagine a tree with roots, leaves, and a core.

00:00:28.449 --> 00:00:34.139
The Old One is the trunk, the core of the tree. It spreads its roots into the lands full of humans, and

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:40.079
the fog drains their souls. As a creatures soul diminishes, they become soul starved;

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:46.079
paranoid, insane, and full of rage.The mad attacked the sane, and chaos prevails.

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:52.739
The only way to stay sane is to collect souls, and so souls become the only valid currency in Boletaria.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:58.469
Those who feed on human souls or pledge themselves to the old one become demons,

00:00:59.109 --> 00:01:02.039
reflecting myth, and the person or thing that they were before.

00:01:03.039 --> 00:01:05.039
Take the major demon, Phalanx.

00:01:05.229 --> 00:01:12.149
It is the corrupted soul form of a longbow sniper, Oolan; who fought from a distance, and never put her life on the line.

00:01:12.729 --> 00:01:14.729
A coward.

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:17.309
And so, demons begin to take over;

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:21.500
infecting the world, spreading the fog, and wiping out humanity.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:27.220
A man named Thomas lived near the palace with his wife and daughter before the scourge came.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.120
His equipment suggests that he was a hunter

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:32.920
and perhaps this is how he provided for his family.

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:36.140
In the Nexus however, he took up a new profession.

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:38.340
I'm Stockpile Thomas.

00:01:38.979 --> 00:01:40.979
When the scourge came, I...

00:01:41.979 --> 00:01:45.389
abandoned my wife and daughter, and fled like a madman.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:49.350
When I came to, I was in the Nexus.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.369
I haven't dared venture outside these walls since.

00:01:54.909 --> 00:01:56.938
Sometimes I stop and wonder...

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:00.730
How I ended up in the Nexus in the first place?

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:04.120
Why didn't I protect my wife and daughter?

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.700
Even if it meant being slain by the demons?

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:09.260
[laughs in disbelief]

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.420
Please forgive me. I am over it now.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:17.720
With no formal combat training, and no courage in the face of the demons,

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:19.720
Thomas left his wife and daughter behind;

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:23.720
instead fleeing from the scourge taking over the Boletarian palace.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:27.160
He accepts himself as weak and puts his hope instead

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:31.040
into the demon slayers who venture outside the safe walls of the Nexus.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:38.200
This rejuvenating sanctorium is a fine place for the slayers of demons

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.320
to rest their weary bones.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.740
I too must contribute how I can;

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:47.000
for we are indebted to our honorable defenders.

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:50.300
True to his new name

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:54.760
Stockpile Thomas lightens the loads of the demon hunters who come through the nexus;

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:58.560
looking after any excess baggage they might have until they return.

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:02.410
What is the world like outside the Nexus?

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:06.970
With brave souls like you confronting these vile demons-

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:11.199
perhaps it won't be long before things return to normal.

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.980
At least that is what we are all praying for.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:21.070
He cannot know for sure whether his wife and daughter fell at the hands of the demons.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:23.620
Maybe they found refuge somewhere;

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:25.220
maybe they're being held prisoner.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.040
Thomas has no closure.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:32.520
Alas, his wife and daughter did die at the hands of the demons.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:38.139
You find two corpses, suspended by chains from the side of a tower in the palace.

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:43.600
On one of the bodies you find a jade hair ornament, which identifies her as Thomas' daughter.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:49.779
The other wears raggedy robes and carries fresh spice a consumable item used by magicians.

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:53.600
It's unknown why the demon singled out his family to be hung.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.860
Most corpses are left on the ground.

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.040
Perhaps, it's because there were women.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:03.060
Or perhaps they were identified as witches, and suffered at the hands of the fat ministers before their death.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:08.320
Either way, you return the hairpin to Thomas, confirming the death of his family.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.980
That hairpin...

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:14.660
That belongs to my daughter.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:16.780
Then...

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.700
She didn't make it after at all-

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.280
My dearest little baby

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:23.560
May she rest in peace.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:28.720
Poor Thomas can let go now

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:31.200
With the knowledge that his wife and daughter are at peace.

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:32.780
Nothing can be done for them

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:35.440
so the coward focuses on giving you his support-

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:38.160
for you fight on his behalf.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.160
You're a saint;

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:45.260
Thank you. Thank you so much!

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:48.280
How do you do it?

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:52.160
I can't imagine what it takes to slay a demon.

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:55.960
If only I had that kind of strength-

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:59.040
If only I could assist in this fight..

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.620
You have a heart of gold.

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.220
Don't let them take it from you!

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:14.980
On the first day

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:16.980
man was granted a soul

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.020
and with it, clarity.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.620
For in man, great potential was seen.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:23.180
Yet

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:24.740
on the second day

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:27.560
upon Earth was planted an irrevocable poison;

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:29.800
a soul devouring demon.

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:32.380
For, like the demon

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:35.660
man had an insatiable, destructive appetite for souls;

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.160
for power...

